WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.767
Machine learning separates the information used for prediction from the outcome we want to predict.

00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:10.472
The input columns are commonly called features and stored in X.

00:00:10.472 --> 00:00:14.717
The outcome is the target and is commonly stored in y.

00:00:14.717 --> 00:00:19.514
Here hours and practice become X, while passed becomes y.

00:00:19.964 --> 00:00:22.861
This separation is conceptually important.

00:00:22.861 --> 00:00:26.016
The model is allowed to learn from the features.

00:00:26.016 --> 00:00:29.327
The target is the answer it is trying to learn to predict.
